= Lifecycle status =

[[Has type::Text]]

The maintenance/lifecycle state of a knowledge object, separate from its evidentiary standing.

Typical values may include:

* <code>Active</code>
* <code>Superseded</code>
* <code>Deprecated</code>
* <code>Archived</code>

A deprecated or archived object can still be historically important or accurately describe the state of knowledge at an earlier time.

See [[BITwiki:Epistemics]] and [[BITwiki:Epistemic status]].
